<title>USA: Coastal Physician settles lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Coastal Physician settles lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said on Wednesday that it has settled a lawsuit over its employment agreement with the former president of the company.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement with Joseph Piemont, who resigned as president of the company in September 1996, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the settlement, Coastal Physician said it will issue share of a new series of convertible preferred stock to reimburse Dr. Steven Scott and Dr. Bertram Walls.</p>
